# Kioptrix Level 1.1 - Reconnaissance & Enumeration

## Overview

This repository documents the reconnaissance and enumeration phase performed against the Kioptrix Level 1.1 vulnerable machine.

The objective of this project was to identify exposed services, enumerate available resources, fingerprint technologies, and research potential attack vectors without performing exploitation.

This repository focuses only on the information gathering stage of a penetration test.

---

## Objectives

- Discover live hosts
- Identify open ports
- Enumerate running services
- Detect software versions
- Fingerprint web technologies
- Enumerate SMB services
- Analyze SSL configuration
- Research publicly known vulnerabilities

